      "text": "什么这些玩意"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 226,
      "start_ms": 555430,
      "end_ms": 559350,
      "text": "老实说5年一烂"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 227,
      "start_ms": 559350,
      "end_ms": 560070,
      "text": "5年一烂啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 228,
      "start_ms": 560070,
      "end_ms": 561510,
      "text": "我甚至说几年就会烂一下"
