      "start_ms": 634250,
      "end_ms": 636440,
      "text": "或者北方哪个省份要搞一个什么东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 265,
      "start_ms": 636440,
      "end_ms": 639110,
      "text": "然后把这个深圳的哪个什么几千个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 266,
      "start_ms": 639110,
      "end_ms": 641570,
      "text": "什么比较熟练的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 267,
      "start_ms": 641570,
      "end_ms": 647450,
      "text": "比较比较这个这就比较比较成熟"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 268,
      "start_ms": 647450,
      "end_ms": 654260,
      "text": "能够能够承担这个任务的呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 269,
      "start_ms": 654260,
      "end_ms": 658460,
      "text": "一些官员几千个调过去嗯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 270,
      "start_ms": 658460,
      "end_ms": 661250,
      "text": "然后呢是一下子就改观了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 271,
      "start_ms": 661250,
      "end_ms": 663260,
      "text": "这个不是说换了人就改观的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 272,
      "start_ms": 663260,
      "end_ms": 667430,
      "text": "而是说要让这些人精英要到位"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 273,
      "start_ms": 667430,
      "end_ms": 669110,
      "text": "另外一方面也要放权给他们"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 274,
      "start_ms": 669110,
      "end_ms": 670730,
      "text": "让他们去塑造那个制度"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 275,
      "start_ms": 670730,
      "end_ms": 673390,
      "text": "现实塑造人的制度框架和那里的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 276,
      "start_ms": 673390,
      "end_ms": 678430,
      "text": "一个就是整个的治理机器治理架构要放权"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 277,
      "start_ms": 678430,
      "end_ms": 682690,
      "text": "要让他们敢敢于去建构自己的一个这个体系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 278,
      "start_ms": 682690,
      "end_ms": 684910,
      "text": "哪怕就是在局部的建构这个体系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 279,
      "start_ms": 684910,
      "end_ms": 689780,
      "text": "然后在聪明的上风说上峰是一个什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 280,
      "start_ms": 689780,
      "end_ms": 691880,
      "text": "是一个什么反贼口号"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 281,
      "start_ms": 691880,
      "end_ms": 692420,
      "text": "不是的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 282,
      "start_ms": 692420,
      "end_ms": 693860,
      "text": "我我喜欢说上风"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 283,
      "start_ms": 693860,
      "end_ms": 695780,
      "text": "因为我年轻的时候看过很多"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 284,
      "start_ms": 695780,
      "end_ms": 698900,
      "text": "这个是那个那个小说啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 285,
      "start_ms": 698900,
      "end_ms": 700460,
      "text": "很多那个穿越小说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 286,
      "start_ms": 700460,
      "end_ms": 703190,
      "text": "穿越小说里面都把那个上级叫上风了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 287,
      "start_ms": 703190,
      "end_ms": 708160,
      "text": "他这个封建封建官僚层级制里面的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 288,
      "start_ms": 708160,
      "end_ms": 709480,
      "text": "那我也讲的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 289,
      "start_ms": 709480,
      "end_ms": 712660,
      "text": "就是说啊稍微还算有点头脑的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 290,
      "start_ms": 712660,
      "end_ms": 714970,
      "text": "上级会把这些比较好的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 291,
      "start_ms": 714970,
      "end_ms": 716330,
      "text": "比较有闯劲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 292,
      "start_ms": 716330,
      "end_ms": 719510,
      "text": "比较有有这个现实的判断啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 293,
      "start_ms": 719510,
      "end_ms": 722690,
      "text": "决决断能力的这些年轻人建构出来的新的制度"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 294,
      "start_ms": 722690,
      "end_ms": 723950,
      "text": "现实放大调整"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 295,
      "start_ms": 723950,
      "end_ms": 727089,
      "text": "然后再运用到其他的其他的范围"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 296,
      "start_ms": 727089,
      "end_ms": 728169,
      "text": "其他领域当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 297,
      "start_ms": 728169,
      "end_ms": 733209,
      "text": "能够让整个行政机器治理体系有一个质的改观"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 298,
      "start_ms": 733209,
      "end_ms": 735295,
      "text": "质"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 299,
      "start_ms": 736580,
      "end_ms": 739960,
      "text": "所以我这个这个就说了嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 300,
      "start_ms": 739960,
      "end_ms": 747410,
      "text": "我觉得嗯这种东西你也不好埋怨"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 301,
      "start_ms": 747410,
      "end_ms": 749330,
      "text": "教育是不是你也不好埋怨"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 302,
      "start_ms": 749330,
      "end_ms": 751709,
      "text": "具体的个人不是特别好埋怨"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 303,
      "start_ms": 751709,
      "end_ms": 753329,
      "text": "具体的个人没什么好埋怨的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 304,
      "start_ms": 753329,
      "end_ms": 756370,
      "text": "而且要看到他是一个力格局"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 305,
      "start_ms": 756370,
      "end_ms": 759790,
      "text": "力量对比是不是很强硬的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 306,
      "start_ms": 759790,
      "end_ms": 761740,
      "text": "非常强硬的嗯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 307,
      "start_ms": 761740,
      "end_ms": 762670,
      "text": "一动全动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 308,
      "start_ms": 762670,
      "end_ms": 764290,
      "text": "牵一发动全身"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 309,
      "start_ms": 764290,
      "end_ms": 768610,
      "text": "一改全改这种一权关系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 310,
      "start_ms": 768610,
      "end_ms": 770710,
      "text": "如果最后将此固化到一定程度的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 311,
      "start_ms": 770710,
      "end_ms": 771730,
      "text": "那就没办法了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 312,
      "start_ms": 771730,
      "end_ms": 775550,
      "text": "只能说老八一揭就全揭掉了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 313,
      "start_ms": 775550,
      "end_ms": 778010,
      "text": "因为下面的新肉已经长好了嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 314,
      "start_ms": 778010,
      "end_ms": 779000,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 315,
      "start_ms": 779000,
      "end_ms": 781340,
      "text": "你想要见到翻天覆地的变化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 316,
      "start_ms": 781340,
      "end_ms": 784220,
      "text": "可以下面的新的肉已经快长得差不多了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 317,
      "start_ms": 784220,
      "end_ms": 785180,
      "text": "或者说下面的新肉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 318,
      "start_ms": 785180,
      "end_ms": 785960,
      "text": "你把它揭开了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 319,
      "start_ms": 785960,
      "end_ms": 788180,
      "text": "它虽然还有一些是裂的还是伤的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 320,
      "start_ms": 788180,
      "end_ms": 790320,
      "text": "但是它暴露在风霜当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 321,
      "start_ms": 790320,
      "end_ms": 793590,
      "text": "风雨当中他也不会不容易腐败了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 322,
      "start_ms": 793590,
      "end_ms": 796350,
      "text": "它能抵抵御外部的刺激了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 323,
      "start_ms": 796350,
      "end_ms": 797250,
      "text": "承受的住啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 324,
      "start_ms": 797250,
      "end_ms": 798060,
      "text": "不是刺激了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 325,
      "start_ms": 798060,
      "end_ms": 801850,
      "text": "这个时候老八一接这个疤全都揭开了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 326,
      "start_ms": 802190,
      "end_ms": 803530,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 327,
      "start_ms": 803530,
      "end_ms": 809260,
      "text": "所以这个过程其实说有就是快刀斩乱麻"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 328,
      "start_ms": 809260,
      "end_ms": 811579,
      "text": "其实反而不痛苦的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 329,
      "start_ms": 812039,
      "end_ms": 814830,
      "text": "但是他得有一个前提"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 330,
      "start_ms": 814830,
      "end_ms": 817470,
      "text": "就是它下面的新肉都已经开始涨了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 331,
      "start_ms": 817470,
      "end_ms": 818670,
      "text": "长得都差不多了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 332,
      "start_ms": 818670,
      "end_ms": 819990,
      "text": "我目前老实说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 333,
      "start_ms": 819990,
      "end_ms": 822960,
      "text": "我看中国的这些年轻人再激进"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 334,
      "start_ms": 822960,
      "end_ms": 825110,
      "text": "后面那老鬼有一些那种"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 335,
      "start_ms": 825110,
      "end_ms": 828350,
      "text": "最近不是把某个姓刘的老鬼捧起来的吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 336,
      "start_ms": 828350,
      "end_ms": 831030,
      "text": "他们自己圈子里面人把他捧起来了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 337,
      "start_ms": 831030,
      "end_ms": 835110,
      "text": "称之为什么我们的M派的什么的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 338,
      "start_ms": 835110,
      "end_ms": 838010,
      "text": "什么信任的头脑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 339,
      "start_ms": 838170,
      "end_ms": 839660,
      "text": "我觉得他这样搞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 340,
      "start_ms": 839660,
      "end_ms": 841670,
      "text": "他离牢狱不远了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 341,
      "start_ms": 841670,
      "end_ms": 846780,
      "text": "姓刘的名字里面有个明亮的明"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 342,
      "start_ms": 849600,
      "end_ms": 851240,
      "text": "名字里面有个明亮的明"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 343,
      "start_ms": 852260,
      "end_ms": 853700,
      "text": "这是个标准投机客啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 344,
      "start_ms": 853700,
      "end_ms": 855800,
      "text": "老牌投机客"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 345,
      "start_ms": 857520,
      "end_ms": 858860,
      "text": "啊老牌投机客"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 346,
      "start_ms": 858860,
      "end_ms": 861620,
      "text": "他最近在外网大出风头"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 347,
      "start_ms": 861620,
      "end_ms": 862460,
      "text": "他不要命了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 348,
      "start_ms": 862460,
      "end_ms": 864470,
      "text": "这个人他以为他能捡他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 349,
      "start_ms": 864470,
      "end_ms": 869139,
      "text": "他以为那个谁谁谁谁的什么侄子出来讲话了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 350,
      "start_ms": 869139,
      "end_ms": 871899,
      "text": "以为他这个又有他们的活动空间了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 351,
      "start_ms": 871899,
      "end_ms": 874620,
      "text": "我觉得他是判断错形式了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 352,
      "start_ms": 874900,
      "end_ms": 877350,
      "text": "我觉得是判断错误形式了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 353,
      "start_ms": 877350,
      "end_ms": 879930,
      "text": "那个谁谁谁的侄子出来活动的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 354,
      "start_ms": 879930,
      "end_ms": 880770,
      "text": "也只能一口一个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 355,
      "start_ms": 880770,
      "end_ms": 883940,
      "text": "我不知道我不懂不知道不知道不懂不知道不懂"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 356,
      "start_ms": 883940,
      "end_ms": 884600,
      "text": "如果有的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 357,
      "start_ms": 884600,
      "end_ms": 885140,
      "text": "如果有的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 358,
      "start_ms": 885140,
      "end_ms": 886400,
      "text": "不知道不懂不知道不懂"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 359,
      "start_ms": 886400,
      "end_ms": 888840,
      "text": "他也不敢说什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 360,
      "start_ms": 891540,
      "end_ms": 893600,
      "text": "我是觉得这个是海内"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 361,
      "start_ms": 893600,
      "end_ms": 897050,
      "text": "稍微还残存一点理性和良知的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 362,
      "start_ms": 897050,
      "end_ms": 899610,
      "text": "是不会随他们走的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 363,
      "start_ms": 900070,
      "end_ms": 902130,
      "text": "在乱搞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 364,
      "start_ms": 903500,
      "end_ms": 904300,
      "text": "在乱玩"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 365,
      "start_ms": 904300,
      "end_ms": 904840,
      "text": "在乱搞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 366,
      "start_ms": 904840,
      "end_ms": 906340,
      "text": "我觉得没有意思好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 367,
      "start_ms": 906340,
      "end_ms": 908140,
      "text": "这跳梁小丑跳出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 368,
      "start_ms": 909520,
      "end_ms": 912200,
      "text": "所以目前只看到跳梁小丑在跳"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 369,
      "start_ms": 912200,
      "end_ms": 913100,
      "text": "年轻人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 370,
      "start_ms": 913100,
      "end_ms": 914840,
      "text": "说真的说真的新生力量"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 371,
      "start_ms": 914840,
      "end_ms": 915770,
      "text": "新的未来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 372,
      "start_ms": 915770,
      "end_ms": 919760,
      "text": "像这个疤痕下面的这个肉长的也已经"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 373,
      "start_ms": 919760,
      "end_ms": 923160,
      "text": "这个啊能够抵御风雨了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 374,
      "start_ms": 923160,
      "end_ms": 924540,
      "text": "我没看见好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 375,
      "start_ms": 924540,
      "end_ms": 926060,
      "text": "我没看见"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 376,
      "start_ms": 927000,
      "end_ms": 928520,
      "text": "所以他正常的皮肤组织"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 377,
      "start_ms": 928520,
      "end_ms": 929720,
      "text": "你不能说他是疤痕"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 378,
      "start_ms": 929720,
      "end_ms": 933170,
      "text": "刻意的要给自己伤口上划一道疤痕出来的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 379,
      "start_ms": 933170,
      "end_ms": 935630,
      "text": "那是敌人行吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 380,
      "start_ms": 935630,
      "end_ms": 937100,
      "text": "那就讲到这里啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 381,
      "start_ms": 937100,
      "end_ms": 937960,
      "text": "这封信"
